r spiced salmon  with the citrus sumac and broccoli  sprouts are crumbled with cardamom  cinnamon and coconut yogurt  so often we think healthy meals have to  be boring and uninspiring and i hope i  have encouraged you to make yourself a  healthy and delicious gut health  boosting meal today if you want to see  more meals like this let us know in the  comments below i'm kanchan koya thanks  so much for watching oh yes  [Music]
 

